        "collapsible_text_pBaNXc": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Main Specs",
            "content": "<ul><li>Comes 95% Pre-assembled, only need to secure the handrail;</li><li><strong>320 Lbs Capacity</strong></li><li><strong>0-5% Manual Incline</strong></li><li>Can Be Stored <strong>Vertically</strong></li><li><strong>Free App</strong> Subscription</li><li>Quiet Brushless Motor, less than <strong>40dB</strong> when working;</li><li>Speed of 0.6-6.2 mph(Adjustable)</li><li><strong>1-Year</strong> Warranty</li><li>Small Office & Home Friendly</li><li>AI Voice Control | Remote Control | 3D VR</li><li>Only Weighs 41.66 Lbs </li><li>Folded Size: 49.21 x 21.25 x 6.1 in</li><li>Expanded Size：43.3 x 21.3 x 38 in</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_ieDpG4": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "💰30-Day Lowest Price Guarantee💎",
            "content": "<p>If the price of your purchase drops within 30 days of your order, or if you find the same product available at a lower price through another authorized sales channel, simply contact us. <strong>We'll gladly refund the difference.</strong><br/><br/>*Only applicable to orders placed on or after June 4, 2026.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_AaPGYX": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the difference between the Standard and the Gift Edition?",
            "content": "<p>Both versions offer the same functionality and performance. The differences are mainly in the design and packaging.</p><ul><li><strong>Standard Version:</strong> Classic black color with standard packaging.</li><li><strong>Gift Version:</strong> Elegant purple finish with additional decorative accents for a more premium appearance. It also comes in a beautifully designed gift box, making it ready to gift right out of the package.</li></ul><p>The Gift Version is designed for customers who want a more special presentation and an unforgettable gifting experience.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_etCW8W": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "30-Day Risk-Free Return & 1-Year Warranty Support",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\"><strong>30-Day Return Window</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Enjoy a simple & <strong>hassle-free return</strong> process — WELLFIT will offer custmers a pre-paid return label when<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\"><strong>applicable</strong></a>. Customers don't need to pay for the return shipping.</p><p>How the <strong>1-Year Warranty</strong> Works:</p><ul><li><strong>a)Part Replacement: </strong>Send us a video of the issue, and we'll ship the required parts along with step-by-step video instructions. </li><li><strong>b)Local Repair: </strong>If a local technician is more convenient, you may have the repair done locally with WELLFIT approval. Just send us a video of the issue before repair and a copy of the receipt after-we'll reimburse the cost.</li><li><strong>c)Free Replacement:</strong> If the product cannot be repaired during the warranty period, you will get a free replacement.</li><li><strong>d)Full or Partial Refund: </strong>If repair or replacement isn't feasible or preferred, we may offer a refund based on the product's condition and the issue's severity.</li><li><strong>e)Professional Support:</strong> We provide professional support with a dedicated technical team for online technical assistance.</li></ul><p><strong>*Note:</strong> WELLFIT will evaluate the actual situation and offer our customers best solution.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_4wQ4k6": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tax-Free, No Extra Tax Added At Checkout",
            "content": "<p>Purchase directly from the WELLFIT treadmill official website and enjoy <strong>tax-free</strong> benefits, as WELLFIT will cover the sales tax. Consumers <strong>do not need to pay the 7%-15% sales tax</strong>.  Compared with buying on other platforms, saving you more. Our official website also honors <strong>1-year </strong>free warranty. Strong warranty protection for peace of mind.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_TCr478": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's in The Box",
            "content": "<ul><li>1 x <strong>Gift Package Box</strong></li><li>1 x Treadmill</li><li>1 x Remote Control</li><li>1 x User Manual</li><li>1 x Power Cable</li><li>1 x Lubricant</li><li>1 x Tablet / Phone Holder</li><li>1 x Safety Key</li><li>2 x Handrail Locking Bolts</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
